<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2422_9317.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Edlen, Erenvesten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fromen</unclear>, Fuersichtigen, Ersamen unnd Wysen,
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heren</unclear> Burgermeister, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innsonders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guenstigen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hochehrenden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Heren</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ihnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seyen</unclear> myn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotwillige</unclear> dienst und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear>, sampt was ich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eh</unclear>-
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ren</unclear>, liebs unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guots</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermocht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allzyts</unclear> zuvor. By <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ist</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erschin</unclear>-
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeiger</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diß</unclear>, myn lieber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">amptsangehoeriger</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Joerg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pfenninger</unclear></persName>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gyrenbad</unclear></placeName>, unnd mir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">klagende</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuergebracht</unclear>: wie im der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Heren</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>burger, m. <persName resp="#ner">Conradt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Kuenz</unclear></persName> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">metzger</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">onguar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">4</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wochen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschinner</unclear> <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wienacht</unclear></date>, umb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aberkouffung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">2</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">houpt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kuoevich</unclear>,
<lb n="9"/>9 1/2 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fl</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zrichm</unclear> schuldig worden, und daruf ime wybel zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-425" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Bae-
<lb n="10"/>retschwyl</placeName>, im bywessen <persName resp="#ner">Ruodolff Bossharten</persName> deß wierts daselbst,
<lb n="11"/><persName resp="#ner">Jochym Pfennigers</persName> im <placeName resp="#ner">Gyrenbad</placeName> und <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacob</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kuentzen</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußem</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-295" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Thal</placeName>, anglobt habe, das er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dennselben</unclear> gellt, an guoter
<lb n="13"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuericher</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muentz</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waerung</unclear>, ohne <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einigen</unclear> synen costen und schad-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear>, uff <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Oßren</unclear></date> nechstverschinen ußrichten und bezalen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woelle</unclear>.
<lb n="15"/>Als er aber mit der zalung sye <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsumpt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">were</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derhalben</unclear> ge-
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">trungen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">botten</unclear> darumb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuozeschicken</unclear>, da <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hete</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>er by 14 tagen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">onguar</unclear>, ime gellt geschickt, aber die summa nit
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allerklichen</unclear>, zuo dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> ein Spanische <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">duplon</unclear> darunder gweß-
<lb n="19"/>en, so nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waerschafft</unclear>, item zwo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Italienische</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">duplonnen</unclear>, so er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gezelt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Derhalben</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyl</unclear> gar kein costen darby geweß-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">en</unclear>, habe er im das alles wider <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogschickt</unclear>, der hoffnung er
<lb n="22"/>ime nechster tagen vollenklich umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> ansprach, mit sampt dem
<lb n="23"/>costen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lut</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">synes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versprechens</unclear>, bezalen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölte</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Diewyln</unclear> aber das
<lb n="24"/>nit beschechen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">willends</unclear>, ime wider <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">botten</unclear> umb be-
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zalung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuozeschicken</unclear>. Damit er aber nit wyter von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufge</unclear>-
<lb n="26"/>zogen, sonnder desto <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernuegt</unclear> werden moege, hat er mich
<lb n="27"/>ganntz ernstlich umb ein intercession schryben an die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heren</unclear> ge-
<lb n="28"/>bätten, inn hoffnung dessen wol zegeniessen. Wölchs ich ime,
<lb n="29"/>als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüzit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unzimlichs</unclear>, nit verweigeren können. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gelanngt</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>derhalb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> an die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heren</unclear>, myn ganntz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">flißig</unclear> bitt, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woell</unclear>-
<lb n="31"/>en ime <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Joerg</unclear> Pfenninger</persName>, oder synen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">botten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">behielfflich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear>,
<lb n="32"/>das er uffs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehist</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> m. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Kuenz</unclear>, umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußstanndt</unclear>, sampt
<lb n="33"/>1 fl. costen, so er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> schon <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haer</unclear> bezalt, und was der ietzig
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bottenlon</unclear> syn wirt, mit guoter <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Zuericher</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werschaft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">clag</unclear>-
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2422_9318.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="35"/>synes anlobens, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befridigke</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bezale</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> nit zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwerem</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>schaden bringe, daß umb die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Herren</unclear> unnd die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yrrigen</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>(<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">by</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neben</unclear> das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soelichs</unclear> der gebur unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billigkheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehnmeeß</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ig</unclear>) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> derglychen unnd anndern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fählen</unclear> zuoverdienen, weil
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iederzyts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gannz</unclear> geneigt unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotwillig</unclear> erfunden werd=
<lb n="40"/>en, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> damit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">samptlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Goetlicher</unclear> allmacht zuo gnad=
<lb n="41"/>en <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beuelhende</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">datt</unclear> den <origDate when="1623-07-01" resp="#ner">1 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">julij</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">a</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">1623</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="42"/>Der Herren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allzytt</unclear> dienst:
<lb n="43"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotwilliger</unclear>.
<lb n="44"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Hanns Caspar <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heidegger</unclear></persName>, vogt
<lb n="45"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herrschafft</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-413" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grueningen</unclear></placeName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2422_9319.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2422_9320.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="46"/>Den edlen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eerenvessten</unclear>, frommen, fuersichtigen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">er</unclear>-
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">samen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear> herren <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear> der statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. Gallen</orgName>, mynen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> guen-
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stigen</unclear>, hochgeehrten, lieben herren.
</p>
